    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/033226a0968c9a7fe9ca826cb43efe0b.poster.avif?t=1728325094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/033226a0968c9a7fe9ca826cb43efe0b.webm?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/033226a0968c9a7fe9ca826cb43efe0b.mp4?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Rise up in <i>Let\u2019s! Revolution!</i>, a roguelite puzzle mashup that builds on the classic rules of Minesweeper with procedurally generated mazes and turn-based tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a deadly game of hide and seek, chasing the rotten King across the enchanting land of Beebom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your problem-solving skills to the test as you flip tiles to outsmart deadly foes and uncover powerful items and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade the King\u2019s deadly boot-licking lackeys or take them down in strategic turn-based combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up along the way with over 100 items and abilities for a final showdown with the King himself in Beebom City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/6e2fc201f5bd200a47cd4865694c1da4.poster.avif?t=1728325094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/6e2fc201f5bd200a47cd4865694c1da4.webm?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/6e2fc201f5bd200a47cd4865694c1da4.mp4?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the beautifully illustrated and hand-animated world of Beebom in this debut game from award-winning animation house <strong>BUCK</strong>. The original score and sound design by <strong>Antfood</strong> brings Beebom to life as a vibrant sonic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/c28a512e15e25ad283003301a473b26e.avif?t=1728325094\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero from six unique classes, each with their own playstyle and abilities, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Charger</strong>, a powerhouse who unleashes devastating attacks but must keep charging into hidden tiles to gain energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Shadow</strong>, who uses cunning items like Smoke Bombs and Sleep Darts to outwit and outmaneuver enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Oracle</strong>, a master of perception magic who adds extra information to navigate the mazes with superior logic and teleportation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/786d9bd6e8359b72036d7380c7ff0195.avif?t=1728325094\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PEOPLE TO MEET</strong>: From the King and his cronies to the Shopkeepers that help you along the way, you\u2019ll encounter a diverse cast of memorable characters brought to life through expressive animation and cheeky dialogue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEEP IT SIMPLE</strong>: Say goodbye to tiresome calculations and obscure probabilities. Board-game-inspired mechanics keeps the focus on learning abilities and strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GO DEEP</strong>: With 5 levels of NG+ to unlock for each class, expert players can expect to have their skills put to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OR CHILL OUT</strong>: Take a break from the challenge with Easy Mode, perfect for more casual players or those who want to overthrow the monarchy at their own pace.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/033226a0968c9a7fe9ca826cb43efe0b.poster.avif?t=1728325094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/033226a0968c9a7fe9ca826cb43efe0b.webm?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/033226a0968c9a7fe9ca826cb43efe0b.mp4?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Rise up in <i>Let\u2019s! Revolution!</i>, a roguelite puzzle mashup that builds on the classic rules of Minesweeper with procedurally generated mazes and turn-based tactics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a deadly game of hide and seek, chasing the rotten King across the enchanting land of Beebom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your problem-solving skills to the test as you flip tiles to outsmart deadly foes and uncover powerful items and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Evade the King\u2019s deadly boot-licking lackeys or take them down in strategic turn-based combat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gear up along the way with over 100 items and abilities for a final showdown with the King himself in Beebom City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/6e2fc201f5bd200a47cd4865694c1da4.poster.avif?t=1728325094\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/6e2fc201f5bd200a47cd4865694c1da4.webm?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/6e2fc201f5bd200a47cd4865694c1da4.mp4?t=1728325094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the beautifully illustrated and hand-animated world of Beebom in this debut game from award-winning animation house <strong>BUCK</strong>. The original score and sound design by <strong>Antfood</strong> brings Beebom to life as a vibrant sonic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/c28a512e15e25ad283003301a473b26e.avif?t=1728325094\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your hero from six unique classes, each with their own playstyle and abilities, including:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Charger</strong>, a powerhouse who unleashes devastating attacks but must keep charging into hidden tiles to gain energy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Shadow</strong>, who uses cunning items like Smoke Bombs and Sleep Darts to outwit and outmaneuver enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Oracle</strong>, a master of perception magic who adds extra information to navigate the mazes with superior logic and teleportation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2111090/extras/786d9bd6e8359b72036d7380c7ff0195.avif?t=1728325094\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PEOPLE TO MEET</strong>: From the King and his cronies to the Shopkeepers that help you along the way, you\u2019ll encounter a diverse cast of memorable characters brought to life through expressive animation and cheeky dialogue. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEEP IT SIMPLE</strong>: Say goodbye to tiresome calculations and obscure probabilities. Board-game-inspired mechanics keeps the focus on learning abilities and strategic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GO DEEP</strong>: With 5 levels of NG+ to unlock for each class, expert players can expect to have their skills put to the ultimate test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>OR CHILL OUT</strong>: Take a break from the challenge with Easy Mode, perfect for more casual players or those who want to overthrow the monarchy at their own pace.</p>",
    "short_description": "Let\u2019s! Revolution! is a colorful roguelite puzzle mashup about stopping a narcissistic King from ruining your world. Flip tiles to uncover the hidden path to the King. Use deductive reasoning to avoid his cronies or take them all down in strategic turn-based combat.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean",
    "reviews": "\u201cSuperbly presented with oceans of strategic depth, Let's! Revolution! is a spirited fantasy roguelite that gives Minesweeper a vibrant new lease of life.\u201d<br>RPS Bestest Bests \u2013 Rock, Paper, Shotgun<br><br>\u201cUnique, challenging, deep, fun and even gleefully bizarre in certain ways, Let\u2019s! Revolution! is a truly superb blend of puzzlers, strategy games and dungeon crawlers that easily makes for one of this year\u2019s most pleasant surprises.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Hardcore Gamer<br><br>\u201cWith new game plus modes and plenty of additional content to unlock, this game will keep puzzle fans busy and satiated for a heck of a long time\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 GodisaGeek<br>",
